## Critical
- `src/useHooks/useCalendarEvents.tsx`: `removeAllEvents()` 现在把“服务端删除成功”直接视为整体成功，但 `removeAllEventsSilent()` 已经不再返回失败态，只要没权限或本地删除异常就统一返回 `0`。这样会出现“服务端已删、本地系统日历没删掉、页面却提示删除成功”的假阳性，属于明显回归。

```332:372:src/useHooks/useCalendarEvents.tsx
const removeAllEventsSilent = async (): Promise<number> => {
  try {
    const status = await RNCalendarEvents.checkPermissions();
    if (status !== 'authorized') {
      return 0;
    }
    // ...
    return removedCount;
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Error removing events (silent):', error);
    return 0;
  }
};
```

```376:411:src/useHooks/useCalendarEvents.tsx
const removeAllEvents = async (): Promise<boolean> => {
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    refOnConfirm.current = async () => {
      try {
        const removeResult = await calendar_v1_delete_schedules({
          contains: [],
          all: true
        });

        if (removeResult === false) {
          resolve(false);
          return;
        }

        const removedCount = await removeAllEventsSilent();

        await storage.setItem(lastRequestKey, null);

        setTimeout(() => {
          setCommonAlertModalTitle(global.i18n.t('delete_success', { removedCount }));
          // ...
        }, Platform.OS === 'ios' ? 1000 : 0);

        resolve(true);
      } catch (error) {
        resolve(false);
      }
    };
